"_62":98,"_99":-7},{"_60":91,"_62":92,"_64":93,"_66":94,"_75":76},{"_60":77,"_62":78,"_64":79,"_80":81,"_82":83,"_34":84,"_85":86,"_87":88,"_89":90},{"_60":70,"_62":71,"_64":72,"_73":74,"_75":76},{"_60":61,"_62":63,"_64":65,"_66":67},"type","links","field","originalImage","label","创作者原图","items",[68],{"_64":65,"_27":69},"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0045cc0c-b7c0-4c99-be13-c13f2c66cef2","text","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","The creator’s in-game title screen and supermarket scene; this is not a GameMap execution of the Windows release.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/supermarket-simulator-cursor.webp","alt","The creator’s running supermarket game at its title menu, showing store shelves and two characters.","https://github.com/breineng/supermarket-simulator#description","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[95],"Cursor","相关资源",[100],"resourceIds","section",{"_64":101,"_27":102},"Unity · Manual","/zh/resources/unity-engine/","创作者开发记录",[106],"evidence",{"_64":107,"_27":84,"_108":109},"查看作者的 AI 使用说明","note","Author README names coding models, Hunyuan assets, source setup and a linked creation video. Source-checked; full reproduction not performed.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[114],{"_64":115,"_27":116,"_108":117},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/breineng/supermarket-simulator","Complete Unity 2023.2.6f1 project with Assets, Packages and ProjectSettings. Scenes, prefabs and models use Git LFS: clone with LFS and run git lfs pull before opening Assets/Scenes/InitScene.unity. MIT code; Unity, generated models and dependencies retain their terms. LFS objects were not fetched in this review.","获取方式","download","demo","试玩与运行",[123],{"_64":124,"_27":125,"_108":126},"Download the Windows game","https://github.com/breineng/supermarket-simulator/releases/download/0.0.1/SupermarketSimulator.zip","Windows download, about 397 MB, from release 0.0.1. Extract and run Supermaket Simulator.exe. Other platforms require a source build; the binary was not downloaded or executed in this review.","游戏平台","GitHub Releases","指南形式","disclosure","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[134],{"_64":135,"_27":84,"_108":-7},"阅读作者的开发说明","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[140,141,142,143],"Download the Windows release and try the order, delivery, stocking and checkout loop.","Read the creator’s build account and linked video to separate coding assistance from generated models.","Clone with Git LFS, fetch the LFS objects and open InitScene in the matching Unity editor.","Adjust one stock, customer or checkout behavior with an agent, then compare a complete customer-service loop.","AI 工作流与开发背景","作者明确列出 Cursor，以及 Gemini 2.5 Pro、Claude Opus 4 和 Claude Sonnet 4，并提供制作视频。“全部由 AI 生成”是作者的开发说明；代码协作、Unity 项目与模型生成需要分别理解。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","引擎","Unity 2023.2.6f1 · URP · C#","engine","lead","3d","ai-assisted",[140,141,142,143],{"_64":173,"_27":84,"_19":130},{"_64":124,"_27":125,"_19":119,"_108":126},{"_64":170,"_27":116,"_108":117,"_171":172},{"_64":169,"_27":84,"_108":109},[168],"unity-engine","Read the creator’s AI attribution","Open the complete game project","scope","complete-project","Read the creator’s development disclosure","example:morbreaker-unity-claude","morbreaker-unity-claude","morBreaker","用挡板引导不断加速的小球，挑战十个难度递增的打砖块关卡，包含多段耐久砖块与本地高分记录。","/zh/examples/morbreaker-unity-claude/",{"_21":175,"_23":176,"_25":177,"_158":237,"_154":238,"_150":161,"_146":235,"_9":239,"_131":240,"_120":241,"_34":242,"_105":243,"_98":244},[181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199],{"_60":23,"_73":176,"_62":23,"_99":-7,"_75":76},{"_60":159,"_73":177,"_62":25,"_99":-7,"_75":37},{"_60":70,"_64":156,"_73":237,"_62":158,"_99":147,"_75":76},{"_60":70,"_64":152,"_73":236,"_62":154,"_99":155,"_75":76},{"_60":70,"_64":148,"_73":149,"_62":150,"_99":151,"_75":37},{"_60":70,"_64":144,"_